      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EGEESE IN HOGGEPOT\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake Geese and smite them on pieces. cast them in a Pot, do thereto half wine and half water. And do thereto a good quantity of onions and herbs. Set it over the fire and cover it fast. make a paste of bread and blood and lay it therewith. Do thereto powder fort and serve it forth.\u003Cbr\u003E"
